  "history": {
    "claims": [
      {
        "text": "Above the blood pond, Fang Yuan hears Tie Xue Leng’s loud voice and names this Gu while the sound hurts his eardrums and makes his brain buzz. That shout is only probing. Tie Xue Leng slightly shouts and does not activate the Gu completely, a form of in-depth control.",
        "chapters": [
          184
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "intro",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "char_fang_yuan",
          "char_tie_xue_leng"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Through the giant puppet’s body, Tie Xue Leng uses it at true power. The puppet opens its mouth and howls. Overwhelming soundwaves rush in all directions like thunder. Nearby bladewing blood bat Gu are killed at once. Farther bat groups fall into disarray and cannot be used for a short period.",
        "chapters": [
          186
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "puppet-howl",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "gu_bladewing_blood_bat_gu"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "When Tie Xue Leng first used it, the power was not strong because he kept it down forcefully. The giant puppet lets him display the Gu’s true power. Numerous Blood Guillotine across the sky are killed as well, and the blood mist disperses.",
        "chapters": [
          186
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "puppet-howl",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "gu_blood_guillotine_gu"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Soundwaves bounce off the walls and the space inside the mountain trembles. With the puppet as the focal point, the blood lake’s water level is forced downward into a bowl shape. Fang Yuan is caught in the crossfire: his white armor almost breaks, about 10% of his aperture’s primeval essence is spent, and his ears buzz until he almost trips.",
        "chapters": [
          186
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "puppet-howl",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      }
    ]
  },
